  "description": "La Di Da For Him by Arabiyat Prestige is a fresh, aromatic, citrus-woody men’s fragrance with a clean modern style and easy everyday wearability. It opens with a bright citrus burst—think lemon, bergamot, and light fruity freshness—creating a crisp, uplifting start. The heart blends aromatics, soft spices, and light woods, giving it a smooth masculine center that feels refined without being heavy. The base settles into cedarwood, amber, musk, and dry earthy woods, adding warmth, depth, and long-lasting clean masculinity. Perfect for customers who enjoy fresh-clean masculine scents with a woody, slightly warm finish suitable for day or night.",
